0153_rule_revoke_keeps_its_decisions — NOT CARRIED AS A STEP: THE DEVICE STORE HAS NO SUCH KEY.

The shared entry gives `routing_decisions.matched_rule_id`'s key to `rules` an ON DELETE SET NULL, so
a rule that filed mail can be deleted. The SQLite twin of `routing_decisions` declares no key on
`matched_rule_id` at all, so deleting a rule there was never refused and there is nothing to change.
